<!-- @opening -->
<p class="story-lead">An engineer can lead a difficult feature but keeps getting feedback about scope. The feedback names a level without saying which work would demonstrate it. Compare the team’s expectations with work the organization needs.</p>

<!-- @before How To Operate At Staff Before You Have The Title :: staff -->
### Calibrate the work with your manager

Agree on one problem whose scope matches the local Staff rubric. Name the teams it affects, the decision you can own and the evidence you will collect. Use role archetypes as examples when discussing which kind of contribution the organization needs. [Staff role archetypes](https://staffeng.com/guides/staff-archetypes/).
